'''FIO''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 218
|rarity = RR
|name1 = FIO
|name2 = FIO CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''FIO CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
She is essentially a worse version of [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]] in every conceivable way. Psychocat has higher range and health, while also having a lower cost and shorter recharge time. The only advantages she has are a quicker attack animation, a faster attack rate and barely higher damage, however her quicker attack rate is mitigated by her slow only being 2 seconds, as opposed to Psychocat's 4 second slow. On top of this, she only has a 20% chance to slow, while Psychocat has a 50% chance. Additionally, Psychocat is also a Rare Cat, meaning they can both be used in {{4c}} stages, meaning there is no possible reason to use her over Psychocat.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

